    "notes": "Inspected all25 medium-fi views: street/block/skyline with procedural neighbors at noon and late afternoon in Economy/High, an untextured silhouette, four architectural details, four complete-ruin levels and all transitions. Levels630/1830/3494/5486 retain the roofless circular podium, three tall columns plus stump, shorter cella wall and broken curved entablature. District adds base profiles and podium marble panels; street adds coarse flutes, capitals and dentils; closeup adds selected finer shaft fluting and leaf masses. Initial skyline+district geometry234308bytes plus four common material graphs. Separate attribute streams avoid duplicate GPU uploads. Physical-device and dense-city measurements remain pending.",
